# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only the studio (code, docs, vendored open data) is version-controlled.
# Videos, renders, downloaded media and third-party library assets stay local.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Every top-level folder is a video project (or local-only material) unless listed below.
# `studio new` moves earlier videos into Produced Video/ — that and zz-* scratch stay local too.
/*/
!/_studio/
!/mcp-openverse-audio/
!/.github/
!/scripts/

# dependencies / temp files
node_modules/
.venv*/
__pycache__/
*.part
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# secrets and local machine config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.mcp.json
_studio/.ytbrowser

# local production log (written by `studio build`; template: history.example.json)
_studio/history.json

# private samples: retired-character art, TTS voice tests
_studio/samples/
_studio/voice-samples/

# third-party library assets — licences forbid or restrict redistribution.
# Re-fetch with the studio commands (README → Library assets); the LICENSES.json ledgers record each source.
_studio/assets/*
!_studio/assets/audio/
!_studio/assets/lottie/
!_studio/assets/svg/
_studio/assets/audio/*
_studio/assets/lottie/*
_studio/assets/svg/*
!_studio/assets/audio/LICENSES.json
!_studio/assets/lottie/LICENSES.json
!_studio/assets/svg/LICENSES.json

# large downloaded binaries / build caches for the media tools (STUDIO.md → Media & quality tools)
_studio/tools/upscayl/bin/
_studio/tools/upscayl/models/
_studio/vendor/maps/_cache/
_studio/tools/media/_page.html

# render outputs (inside video folders, in case one is force-added)
**/renders/
**/capture/footage/
index-ch[0-9]*.html
